{"strongs": "H4983", "word": "מַתַּנְיָ֫הוּ", "translit": "mat.tan.yah", "root": "נתב", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "id.", "definition": "מַתַּנְיָ֫הוּ , מַתַּנְיָה proper name, masculine (compare Gray Prop. N. 294, No. 82 ); — ᵐ5 Μαθθας , Μανθανιας , Ματθανιας , etc.; — 1. מַתַּנְיָה , last king of Judah, name changed to Zedekiah 2Kgs 24:17 . 2. מַתַּנְיָ֫הוּ , Levite name: \\ \\ a. son of Heman 1Chr 25:4 . \\ \\ b. Asaphite 1Chr 25:16 . \\ \\ c. id. , 2Chr 29:13 (Hezekiah's time). 3. מַתַּנְיָה , Levite name: \\ \\ a. Asaphite 1Chr 9:15 ; Neh 11:17 ; Neh 11:22 ; Neh 12:8 ; Neh 12:35 , perhaps = 2 b, c (but much confusion and uncertainty; e.g. ׳ מ is of Hezekiah's time 2Chr 29:13 , and 4th generation before Nehemiah, Neh 11:12 ; Neh 12:35 while contemporary of Zerubbabel Neh 12:8 and of Nehemiah Neh 11:17 ). \\ \\ b. other Levites: (1) 2Chr 20:14 , (2) Neh 12:25 , (3) Neh 13:13 . 4. מַתַּנְיָה , name of several who took strange wives: \\ \\ a. Ezra 10:26 . \\ \\ b. v Ezra 10:27 . \\ \\ c. v Ezra 10:30 . \\ \\ d. v Ezra 10:37 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5452')\">BDB5452</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4983')\">H4983</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5451')\">BDB5451</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5453')\">BDB5453</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מַתַּנְיָ֫הוּ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מַתַּנְיָה</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gray')\">Gray<sup>Prop. N. 294, No. 82</sup></lookup>); — <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Μαθθας</grk>, <grk>Μανθανιας</grk>, <grk>Ματθανιας</grk>, etc.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <bdbheb>מַתַּנְיָה</bdbheb>, last king of Judah, name changed to Zedekiah <ref ref=\"2Kgs 24:17\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(12,24,17)\">2Kgs 24:17</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <bdbheb>מַתַּנְיָ֫הוּ</bdbheb>, Levite name: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> son of Heman <ref ref=\"1Chr 25:4\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(13,25,4)\">1Chr 25:4</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> Asaphite <ref ref=\"1Chr 25:16\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(13,25,16)\">1Chr 25:16</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>id.</highlight>, <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,13)\">2Chr 29:13</ref> (Hezekiah's time). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <bdbheb>מַתַּנְיָה</bdbheb>, Levite name: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> Asaphite <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:15\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,15)\">1Chr 9:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 11:17\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,17)\">Neh 11:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 11:22\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,22)\">Neh 11:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:8\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,8)\">Neh 12:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:35\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,35)\">Neh 12:35</ref>, perhaps = <b>2 b, c</b> (but much confusion and uncertainty; e.g. <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> is of Hezekiah's time <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,13)\">2Chr 29:13</ref>, and 4th generation before Nehemiah, <ref ref=\"Neh 11:12\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,12)\">Neh 11:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:35\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,35)\">Neh 12:35</ref> while contemporary of Zerubbabel <ref ref=\"Neh 12:8\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,8)\">Neh 12:8</ref> and of Nehemiah <ref ref=\"Neh 11:17\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,17)\">Neh 11:17</ref>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> other Levites: (1) <ref ref=\"2Chr 20:14\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(14,20,14)\">2Chr 20:14</ref>, (2) <ref ref=\"Neh 12:25\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,25)\">Neh 12:25</ref>, (3) <ref ref=\"Neh 13:13\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(16,13,13)\">Neh 13:13</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <bdbheb>מַתַּנְיָה</bdbheb>, name of several who took strange wives: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:26\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,26)\">Ezra 10:26</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> v<ref ref=\"Ezra 10:27\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,27)\">Ezra 10:27</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> v<ref ref=\"Ezra 10:30\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,30)\">Ezra 10:30</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> v<ref ref=\"Ezra 10:37\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,37)\">Ezra 10:37</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Kgs 24:17", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 24, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "1Chr 25:4", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 25, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "1Chr 25:16", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 25, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "2Chr 29:13", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 29, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "1Chr 9:15", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Neh 11:17", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 11, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Neh 11:22", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 11, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Neh 12:8", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 12, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Neh 12:35", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 12, "verse": 35}, {"raw": "Neh 11:12", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 11, "ve